{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786916921637836001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"treelike-unamusing-grosbeak","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"aba10cef8ff1729f826a04bb9c08d5594a01896f39b979047a54c51dd65f8fa7","event_uuid":"694b433d-5ee9-4d36-a0a2-2306d9370574","position":{"commit_sha":"1a2c28da74a9e3f3e7244a55ba026bcc5e45f3ab","position":"1786914857540797001-694b433d-5ee9-4d36-a0a2-2306d9370574"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"1bd4968aecfd98bc2d471191ace342d8b157357b031bd411635358fb4ddbeea6","event_uuid":"6c267e00-d2a2-498e-8904-ae1d2f5db2a7","position":{"commit_sha":"4404cf51d3dcd8611ee93c9a98862ac597b747c7","position":"1786914878942200001-6c267e00-d2a2-498e-8904-ae1d2f5db2a7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786914857540797001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6c267e00-d2a2-498e-8904-ae1d2f5db2a7","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"0024-fa99-d5bb-49bc"}],"description":"## Context\nThe default test suite passes but `tests/unit/test_build_provenance.py::test_install_from_sdist_preserves_commit` emits Python's `DeprecationWarning` at line 143: Python 3.14 will filter extracted tar archives by default and may reject files or modify metadata. The test calls `TarFile.extractall(extracted)` without an explicit `filter=` policy.\n\n## Reproduction\nRun the named test with warnings enabled under the repository virtualenv. The warning is deterministic on Python 3.12 and identifies the future 3.14 behavior change.\n\n## Plan\nUse rebar-debug to establish the intended safe extraction policy and prove whether the test fixture requires metadata that a standard filter changes. Apply the smallest compatibility repair with a RED warning-as-error oracle; do not weaken archive-safety behavior.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The named build-provenance test runs with its tar extraction warning promoted to an error and passes.\n- [ ] The selected extraction filter is explicit and justified against the fixture's required metadata.\n- [ ] Existing build-provenance assertions remain unchanged or stronger.\n- [ ] The focused test and repository gates pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["warning","python314","tests"],"ticket_id":"e06a-1450-5e1b-42fc","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Python 3.14 tar extraction warning in build-provenance test","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["694b433d-5ee9-4d36-a0a2-2306d9370574","6c267e00-d2a2-498e-8904-ae1d2f5db2a7"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786916921637836001,"uuid":"e7972ea1-4357-4c8f-8a75-f7f36d484017"}